Description: Pithyx, a self-hosted NAS and server system with a web desktop
 The daemon, the desktop, the console menu, the systemd units and the update keys of a Pithyx box. Installed by the
 image and replaced by update files; the kernel and the ZFS module come with pithyx-kernel.
